/-!
# VIII08 — horizon extension and the endpoint class `MagClass 3 (b_s)`

`b_s(R) = -Y(R) K_s(R)` is `C²` on `(3, ∞)` and has a finite right limit
`b_s(3⁺) = -K_s(1/3)`, with derivative limit
`b_s'(3⁺) = -K_s(1/3) + s(a)/18`.
Hence `b_s` extends to a `C¹` function across `R = 3` by the (permitted, non-physical)
affine continuation, and satisfies `AFDecay 3` by the crude bounds.  This gives
`MagClass 3 (b_s)`.
-/

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

open Set Filter Topology MeasureTheory intervalIntegral
open scoped ContDiff Interval

namespace ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell.ES5.KerrSchild.VIII08

open ExactVacuumAtlas ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell.D
